# Hosts and URLs the weekly link check must skip.
#
# Calibrated on 2026-09-22 by fetching every external link in the repository
# by hand. Only two needed an exception. Nothing else belongs here: a link
# that is genuinely dead must fail the check, which is the point of it.

# The local preview server in the README build instructions. Never reachable
# from a runner, and not a published link.
^http://127\.0\.0\.1:

# Returns 403 to every non-browser client, including curl with a browser user
# agent. The page is live and correct in a browser.
^https://www\.fatf-gafi\.org/
